  'Team > Demo portals opens a **demo renter portal** and a **demo owner portal** with made-up data. Pick a stage at the top (Request sent to Closed for a renter; Application to Earning for an owner) to see what the customer sees then: the next step, the countdown to pickup, the step tracker, the money and what they are sent. Every button only says what it would do: nothing is saved or sent. Every staff member has the same pages under Me > Demo portals, to learn each process.',
